<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 269.30 mln rand S.African bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 269.30 mln rand S.African bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 269.30 million rands worth of South African bonds on Monday after buying 569.69 million on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
